{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/25/7667142/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近左のまつ毛がよく抜ける。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條愛未です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/25/7667142/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぷりぷり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日、ガールポップ「のびのび乃木坂」のロケがありましたとさ(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん......私そういえばよくのびのび乃木坂出てる。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがてぇ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば前回ののびのび乃木坂レゴランド編は観ていただけましたか？  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみもよく小さいころレゴとかで遊んでたりしてたからすごく懐かしかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/25/7667142/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは小さいころレゴで遊んだことあります？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもトリックアートとか楽しいとこたくさん行かせていただいた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがてぇ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日もプリンシパルのお稽古がありましたした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか私...ぶっ飛んだ役が好きみたい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんていうか...ちょっとおかしい役。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごく開放的。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/25/7667142/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねえちーちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうか......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろたまってる質問返しますね！？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみの使ってる香水やボディミストがあったら教えてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プラザに売ってる、Cerejeiraの桜の香りだよ！\nあと、セクシエストファンタジーってやつ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみの好きな男性はどっち？格好いい男の人?かわいい男の人?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー、どっちも持ってる人がいい(#^.^#"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいく見える時もあればカッコよく見える時もある！みたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/25/7667142/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺はあみあみ族に入ってもいいのかな？\n今らりん一家に入ってるんだけど\nあみあみ族にも入ってもいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみもせいらりん好きだから許可する(^_-)笑\nカモン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみに覚えてもらうにはどうすればいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たっくさん握手にくる！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみの好きな洋服屋さん？ブランド\nおしえてーっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"❤EMODA\n❤SLY\n❤TOPSHOP\n❤TWNROOM\n❤JOYRICH"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ、最近は\n誰と一番仲いいのぉ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーみんなと仲いいよー？？\nえー。。本当にみんなと仲良いよー？？\nまあしいて言うならチームNは健在かな(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺栃木県に住んでるんだけど\nあみあみ栃木きたことある(^q^)笑\nあみあみ存在すらしらなそう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと待ってよあみそんなバカじょないんだけどー（；＿；）\n栃木はいったことなーい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでー！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/04/25/7667142/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引き続き稽古がんばってきまーす！"}],"source":"archive"}